---
source: crates/zaun/src/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_help().to_string()
---
Show or change the game's launch options (Steam › Properties › Launch options). Changing them needs Steam to be closed

Usage: zaun steam launch-options [OPTIONS] <GAME>

Arguments:
  <GAME>  The game

Options:
      --set <TEXT>           The new launch options (`%command%` stands for the game; "" for none)
  -v, --verbose...           Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
      --mangohud <MANGOHUD>  Turn the performance overlay (MangoHud) on or off in them [possible values: on, off]
  -h, --help                 Print help (see more with '--help')
